{
  "pattern_id": "hs_pullback_continuation",
  "name": "H&S Pullback Continuation (Long)",
  "category": "chart_patterns",
  "description": "Uses the same H&S detection as the bearish variant but treats the pattern as a pullback within an uptrend. Enters long in the OTE zone after the H&S breakdown completes, with stop below the break-of-structure low. Based on the thesis that H&S patterns in uptrends are pullback setups, not regime changes.",
